# He's got the whole world - spiritual
# Traditionele Afro-Amerikaanse spiritual, voor het eerst gedrukt in 1927 in de bundel
# "Spirituals Triumphant, Old and New" (Wikipedia (en), "He's Got the Whole World in
# His Hands"). Publiek domein.
# Overgenomen uit WHOLE_WO.RLD (WordPerfect 5.1, 1991). Tikfout hersteld: "litlle tinny"
# werd "little tiny". "the whole wild world" in het eerste couplet staat zo in de bron.
# Akkoorden staan in de bron alleen bij het eerste couplet.
{title: He's got the whole world}
{meta: id he-s-got-the-whole-world}
{meta: language en}
{lyricist: traditioneel}
{composer: traditioneel}
{copyright: Public domain}
{meta: license public-domain}
{meta: source Overgenomen uit WHOLE_WO.RLD (WordPerfect 5.1, 1991); herkomst via Wikipedia (en)}
{meta: tag geestelijk}
{meta: tag kampvuur}
{key: C}

{start_of_verse}
He's got the whol[C]e world in His hand
He's got the whole [G]wild world in His hand
He's got the whole [C]world in His hand
He's got the [G]whole world in [F]His hand[C]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
He's got a little tiny baby in His hand (3x)
He's got the whole world in His hand
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
He's got you and me brother in His hand (3x)
He's got the whole world in His hand
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
He's got the wind and rain in His hand (3x)
He's got the whole world in His hand
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
He's got everybody in His hands
He's got everybody here in His hands
He's got everybody in His hands
He's got the whole world in His hand
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
He's got the big round world in His hand (3x)
He's got the whole world in His hand
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
He's got the sun and moon in His hand (3x)
He's got the whole world in His hand
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
He's got my brother and my sister in His hand (3x)
He's got the whole world in His hand
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse}
He's got my father and my mother in His hand (3x)
He's got the whole world in His hand
{end_of_verse}
